Z||000000||beachbomb||12-24-2000||05:50 PM||||Hey all. First off MERRY CHRISTMAS!!! Second, does anyone have any documentation on the '88GT. Once i make room in my garage(i.e. strip down my parts Indy and remove carcuss!) i will be looking for a '88GT. I have always like them but don't know much about them. I'm looking for things like magazine articles, etc..thanks alot..jim(2 '84 Indys)||||reg||10
Z||000001||88formula||12-25-2000||01:17 AM||||You can get the Brooklands road test book on the fiero for about $15 at Barns and Noble bookstore. That book contains articles from magazines on the fiero like Road and Track and Car and Driver.<P>If you type "fiero" in any search engine you will find tons of stuff.<P>Go here! <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/biz/fierosails/info.html#Turbochargers" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/biz/fierosails/info.html#Turbochargers</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||WKDFIRO||12-25-2000||03:27 AM||||I have that book in question and it is filled with many facts about the 88 GTs but I also found it profoundly depressing reading the automotive press just slash the Fiero as it is compared to the Honda CRX and the MR-2...||||reg||9
